<span class="badge badge-warning">Session Ending Soon</span>

<h2>Departure Reminder: Your Parking Session Ends Soon</h2>

<p>Hello <strong>{{customerName}}</strong>,</p>

<p>This is a reminder that your parking reservation will end in approximately <strong>15 minutes</strong>.</p>

<table class="details-table">
  <tr>
    <td class="label">Booking Reference</td>
    <td class="value">{{bookingReference}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="label">Parking Facility</td>
    <td class="value">{{facilityName}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="label">Reservation Date</td>
    <td class="value">{{bookingDate}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="label">Arrival Time</td>
    <td class="value">{{startTime}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="label">Scheduled Departure</td>
    <td class="value">{{endTime}}</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p>Please prepare to exit the facility on or before your scheduled departure time to avoid any overtime parking fees.</p>
